OL,3,ASevere travel disruption possible as
OL,4,Adense fog returns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThick fog could bring severe disruption
OL,7,Fto commuters for a second day this week
OL,8,Facross parts of England and eastern
OL,9,FWales.
OL,11,FA Met Office warning is in place for
OL,12,Fthe fourth consecutive day, this time
OL,13,Fcovering the Midlands, East Anglia, the
OL,14,Fnorthern home counties, Yorkshire and
OL,15,Fthe Humber and parts of Cheshire.
OL,17,FNorth-eastern counties of Wales such as
OL,18,FPowys, Denbighshire, Conwy, Flintshire
OL,19,Fand Wrexham are also included in the
OL,20,Fwarning.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
