OL,3,ATrump says more US attacks on Iran
OL,4,A'highly unlikely'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump has said "Iran militarily
OL,7,Fis effectively over", and said that
OL,8,Fthere is "positive momentum" behind
OL,9,Fnegotiations to end the Middle East
OL,10,Fconflict.
OL,12,F"We're just keeping it the status quo,"
OL,13,Fthe US president said on Monday. "And
OL,14,Fwe're doing that really at the behest
OL,15,Fof countries that are their
OL,16,Fneighbours."
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
